From: MakOS Project <makos@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] platform: complete MakOS libxul link foundations

Select Chromium's documented generic Unix process launcher, add honest MakOS
process metrics, portable native theme, and a real MakOS top-level surface.
Keep unavailable cross-process statistics explicit instead of inventing data.

